ACCELERATOR PROGRAM DETAILS
================================================================================

COHORT STRUCTURE

Duration: 16 weeks
Cohort Size: 12-15 companies
Investment per Company: $500K standard (SAFE)
Equity: 7% standard
Runs: 2 cohorts per year (Spring, Fall)

PROGRAM COMPONENTS

Week 1-2: Onboarding & Assessment
- Team dynamics workshop
- Product-market fit analysis
- Metrics baseline

Week 3-6: Product Development
- User research intensive
- MVP iteration
- Technical architecture review

Week 7-10: Go-to-Market
- Sales training
- Marketing strategy
- Pricing optimization

Week 11-14: Growth & Operations
- Hiring best practices
- Finance & legal fundamentals
- Customer success frameworks

Week 15-16: Fundraising Prep
- Pitch deck development
- Investor introductions
- Demo Day preparation

DEMO DAY

Attendees: 200+ investors
Format: 5-minute pitches
Follow-on Rate: 65% of companies raise within 6 months
Average Series A: $8M

